    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Spirit Knight&quot;</strong> is a challenging 2D action game where players face five powerful bosses, using precise controls and strategy to defeat them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Challenges:</strong> Each stage is an intense boss battle that tests players' reflexes and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Shard System:</strong> Defeat bosses to obtain soul shards, unlocking new abilities and skills to customize your combat style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Attacks:</strong> Combine melee and ranged attacks, and utilize various skills to overcome different challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503980/extras/7b0f9f54e2716e45a5acc48ca92c5e33.poster.avif?t=1754822906\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503980/extras/7b0f9f54e2716e45a5acc48ca92c5e33.webm?t=1754822906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503980/extras/7b0f9f54e2716e45a5acc48ca92c5e33.mp4?t=1754822906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503980/extras/9e4dd8fd152cc6e675213c94ce3246f9.poster.avif?t=1754822906\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503980/extras/9e4dd8fd152cc6e675213c94ce3246f9.webm?t=1754822906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503980/extras/9e4dd8fd152cc6e675213c94ce3246f9.mp4?t=1754822906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Pixel Art:</strong> A pixel-style aesthetic that provides a visually appealing experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music:</strong> Dynamic soundtracks enhance immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability:</strong> Multiple difficulty settings and hidden elements await exploration and challenge.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arrow Keys</strong> \u2192 Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up Arrow Key</strong> \u2192 Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Z Key</strong> \u2192 Attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X Key</strong> \u2192 Use Skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Esc Key</strong> \u2192 Open Settings Menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~ Key</strong> \u2192 Open Soul Shard System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>! Key\u00a0</strong>\u2192 Open Save Screen</p></li></ul>",
